courses.course_syllabus:
Week 1: Course introduction; Camera model, image formation;
Week 2: Practical linear algebra; Image filtering (1)
Week 3: NImage filtering (2); Edge and corner detection;
Week 4: Image features and matching (1); Image features and matching (2)
Week 5: Camera ISP pipeline (1); Camera ISP pipeline (2)
Week 6: Geometric camera model; Camera calibration;
Week 7: Homography and stitching (1); Homography and stitching (2);
Week 8: Binocular stereo (1); Binocular stereo (2);
Week 9: Motion and optical flow (1); Motion and optical flow (2);
Week 10: Radiometry (1); Radiometry (2);
Week 11: Shape from shading; Photometric stereo;
Week 12: Structured light; Advances in Computer Vision;
Week 13: Review session;

